sequenceDiagram
  participant Scheduler
  participant Worker as Celery IMAP Worker
  participant Mail as IMAP Server
  participant API as Flask Domain Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant AI as Email Intelligence Agent
  Scheduler->>Worker: enqueue mailbox sync
  Worker->>DB: load account and UID checkpoint
  Worker->>Mail: connect TLS and select folder
  Mail-->>Worker: UIDVALIDITY and new UIDs
  Worker->>Mail: fetch new messages
  Worker->>Worker: parse MIME, sanitize and scan attachments
  Worker->>API: normalized message
  API->>DB: idempotent insert and thread association
  API->>AI: enqueue classification
  AI-->>DB: store intent, summary and evidence
  Worker->>DB: update last UID and sync state
